Z||000000||rhauser||06-25-2001||08:56 AM||||Does any one have the part numbers for the following on an 85 GT:<P>Headlamp Isolation Relay<BR>Headlamp Actuator Realy<P>Thanks,<BR>Rob||||reg||1
Z||000001||WMEBERT||06-25-2001||10:11 AM||||The Fiero Store has them both and they are reasonably priced.  I work in auto parts and could not find any aftermarket supplier for the Isolator Relay.  "Standard"- a major aftermarket supplier has the Actuator relay available in both their "Standard" and "GP Sorenson" lines.  The GP Sorenson part number is "MR 86".  Advance Auto Parts stocks it for around $18.00.  The Isolator relay goe for $20.95 plus shipping from the Fiero Store.  It is a Genuine GM part too.  I checked with local dealers and the relays are still available from them but their price was higher then the Fiero Store's.  Here are the GM part numbers:<P>Isolator:  10022620<BR>Actuator:  10031018<P>Those numbers are right out of the GM parts catalog.<P>Hope this helps,<P>Bill Ebert<BR>1986 Fiero GT||||reg||3
Z||000002||PBJ||06-25-2001||01:16 PM||||Most of the headlight relays are the same as 95 or older power ant relays mounted on ant motor.  Cheap at wreckers.||||reg||1
